Alembic migrations for the Autonomous SRE Incident Commander.

Migrations run as the schema OWNER role. The application connects as a separate, less
privileged role (`asic_app`) that is subject to row-level security and holds no
UPDATE/DELETE grant on append-only tables.

Connection string comes from ASIC_MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL or ASIC_DATABASE_URL. It is
deliberately absent from alembic.ini so that no credential is ever committed.
